		{
			"id":"bf1c2dd2ac079bec",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Starting room, has three doors and connects to [[The Grounds.canvas|The Grounds]]\n\nContains the [[Welcome Letter.canvas|Welcome Letter]]",
