		{
			"id":"36ee18f375741fda",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Monk Blessing Version\n\nSeems to be the same room, the room may have something in the vases though.\nThere is one allowance token in one of the vases, I do not know if they respawn if you redraw this room.",
